I've read about this countless times, and I've had it happen to me a few
times many years ago, but apparently I STILL haven't learnt my lesson.

Durak the gnomish healer once again dies YASD, by walking into a pit
while wielding a rubber chicken. This was actually the last in a series
of stupid mistakes, so I'm surprisingly not mad about it.

Durak started out as a pacifist genoless wishless polyless wannabe, but
he didn't have what it takes to be pacifist, so succumbed to weaponless
instead. Then he further succumbed to using projectiles (although the
game still considers it weaponless).  RNG was cruel: Minetown bones with
nasty vampire bat, levelport trap in main dungeon sends him 3 levels
into unknown territory, and bumps him into a polytrap (no more
polyless); and food was an issue all the way down to the castle (did
Quest after castle---apparently hungry equine pets ate all the rations
in Sokoban). After clearing the castle with no levitation and no MR,
breaks wishless conduct for GDSM and b=oLev.  And then he goes on his
typical Gehennom Remodelling Streak (with 3 pet umber hulks), and hits a
mastodon with the pick-axe. Bye bye weaponless conduct.

He had his share of blessings:
- early magic whistle
- early gauntlets of Str
- *two* BoH's, early on (Sokoban had =oRefl)
- early touchstone
- altar on Dlvl:4
- early /oDeath
- several /oPM, one of which was used to PM the quest nemesis into an
  soldier ant, so he could just pick up the Staff.
- blessed +2 helm of brilliance at Minebottom
- +5 elven shield amongst random loot
- +4 cloak of protection from Quest
- +4 leather gloves from Ludios
* (These last 4 items proves that patience is key to Nethack: he would
  never have found these things had he not bothered to painstakingly
  sort through the loot)

But he kept making mistakes:
- Eating a gnome. Early on.
- Letting pet kill off minetown coaligned priest AND general shopkeeper
  (no more price-ID), and THEN praying on non-coaligned altar to make
  unholy water (bye bye protection, and no priest to buy it back from
  until Quest/Valley, and angry deity)
- Wasting /oPM on monsters: broke polypileless conduct and wasted the
  wands.
- Allowing MMF to come close to him and suck his brains (he fully had
  the ability of preventing this)
- Wishing he had teleportitis/telecontrol to deal with arch-liches and
  master lichs more efficiently... and then proceeds to eat a nymph
  without any means of telecontrol. Uncontrolled teleportitis with no
  =oTC and no ?oGeno (can't revgen tengus) is NOT fun.
- Wielding a rubber chicken while KNOWINGLY stepping into unsearched
  territory. AND without wearing "oLS, of which he had TWO.

